# WP26 on Shard, 2 clients on maze: they walk, and admission's own account (`console input`) has every snapshot
# within a tile of the client and no corrections; then an admin's rule denies placeBlock, and alpha's placed
# conveyor comes back off its queue with the rule's message (vanilla's removeQueueBlock rollback), and stays queued
# once the rule is gone. Needs player units (WP23) and entity sync (WP25). intent-walk.rig is the walk alone, for
# the comparison with vanilla.
#
#   rig/run.sh --push <shard install> --server '"$RIG"/vm/shard-server.sh maze' --clients 2 --script rig/scenarios/shard-intents.rig
timeout 6m

wait port 90s
alpha: join
bravo: join
all: shot joined

alpha: mark
alpha: hold D 400ms
alpha: expect moved 2
bravo: expect player alpha within 1 5s
alpha: hold W 300ms
alpha: hold A 400ms
alpha: hold S 300ms
bravo: expect player alpha within 1 5s
bravo: mark
bravo: hold W+D 400ms
bravo: expect moved 2
alpha: expect player bravo within 1 5s
all: shot walked

# admission's account: snapshots came, none was over a tile off once applied, none needed a setPosition
wait 2s
console input maze
wait log server /^player alpha snapshots=[1-9][0-9]* lag=[0-9.]+ deviation=0\.[0-9]+ clamped=[0-9]+ corrections=0$/ 10s
wait log server /^player bravo snapshots=[1-9][0-9]* lag=[0-9.]+ deviation=0\.[0-9]+ clamped=[0-9]+ corrections=0$/ 10s

# a deny rule, as an admin (or a plugin's filter) sets it: alpha's plan leaves its queue at once, with the message.
# A click, not `place`: the rig's place waits for the plan to stay queued.
console actions maze deny no-build placeBlock [scarlet]No building here.
wait log server /rule no-build denies placeBlock/ 10s
console actions maze list
wait log server /^rule no-build denies placeBlock message="\[scarlet\]No building here\."$/ 10s
# three tiles right of alpha: the camera follows it, at vanilla's starting scale of 4 (32 px a tile)
alpha: zoom 4
alpha: select conveyor
alpha: rotate 0
alpha: click left screen 736 360
alpha: expect chat /No building here/ 10s
all: shot denied
# without the rule the same plan stays queued (Shard builds nothing yet, so it waits there)
console actions maze allow no-build
wait log server /rule no-build removed/ 10s
alpha: place conveyor screen 736 360 rot 0
all: shot allowed

assert clean all
assert clean server
